{"words": [{"text": "قَالَ", "translation": "He said"}, {"text": "إِنَّهُۥ", "translation": "Indeed, He"}, {"text": "يَقُولُ", "translation": "says"}, {"text": "إِنَّهَا", "translation": "[Indeed] it"}, {"text": "بَقَرَةٌۭ", "translation": "(is) a cow"}, {"text": "لَّا", "translation": "not"}, {"text": "ذَلُولٌۭ", "translation": "trained"}, {"text": "تُثِيرُ", "translation": "to plough"}, {"text": "ٱلْأَرْضَ", "translation": "the earth"}, {"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "and not"}, {"text": "تَسْقِى", "translation": "water"}, {"text": "ٱلْحَرْثَ", "translation": "the field"}, {"text": "مُسَلَّمَةٌۭ", "translation": "sound"}, {"text": "لَّا", "translation": "no"}, {"text": "شِيَةَ", "translation": "blemish"}, {"text": "فِيهَا ۚ", "translation": "in it"}, {"text": "قَالُوا۟", "translation": "They said"}, {"text": "ٱلْـَٔـٰنَ", "translation": "Now"}, {"text": "جِئْتَ", "translation": "you have come"}, {"text": "بِٱلْحَقِّ ۚ", "translation": "with the truth"}, {"text": "فَذَبَحُوهَا", "translation": "So they slaughtered it"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "and not"}, {"text": "كَادُوا۟", "translation": "they were near"}, {"text": "يَفْعَلُونَ", "translation": "(to) doing (it)"}], "sahih": "He said, \"He says, 'It is a cow neither trained to plow the earth nor to irrigate the field, one free from fault with no spot upon her.'\" They said, \"Now you have come with the truth.\" So they slaughtered her, but they could hardly do it."}